# Oracle: run132 (scratchpad vacask/run132, VACASK of .#testing): `mode="lin" points=0` runs one
# frequency (1k); `points=-1` and `points=-3` print "Number of intervals (specified by points
# parameter) must be nonnegative." and run nothing: a negative literal count is refused (P2320).
# Law L5 seed 3 (the IR round): a count of -424 was written -425 and read back (-425 + 1).
# codes: P2320 S0004
file "ac_points_negative.sim" deck
  title "a negative lin interval count"
  analysis ac name=a0 (lin start=1k stop=2k points=1i)
  opaque vacask invalid "analysis a1 ac from=1k to=2k mode=\"lin\" points=-1"
